translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_db7eaca7:

    # "The guard sized me up."
    "경비병이 나를 위아래로 훑어보았다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:113
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_29634847:

    # GUARD "That would be Captain Duprey."
    GUARD "그건 뒤프레 대위일 거다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:114
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_684e944c:

    # GUARD "And I suspect you have no such permit."
    GUARD "그리고 너한테 그런 허가증이 없을 거라고 생각한다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:116
