# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:121
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_CantLeaveSebastian_18c47396:

    # MC "*Sigh* Sir yes sir..."
    MC "하... 네, 알겠습니다..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:127
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_61356499:

    # "That was the building they dragged that poor recruit towards."
    "그것이 그 불쌍한 신병을 끌고 갔던 건물이었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:128
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_a65eabce:

    # "Rows of actual comfy beds, shelves full of various potions and tools, civilian-looking people hurrying about past me..."
    "제대로 된 편안한 침대들이 줄지어 있고, 다양한 물약과 도구로 가득 찬 선반들, 민간인처럼 보이는 사람들이 내 옆을 서둘러 지나가고... "

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:129
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_172c8f4d:

    # "It was clearly a section of the fort fully devoted to supporting our physical well-being."
    "우리의 신체적 안녕을 지원하는 데 전적으로 할애된 요새의 구역임이 분명했다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:131
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_e5bd48af:

    # RECRUIT "Ow! What are you~"
    MC "그냥... 주변을 둘러보고 있었습니다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:132
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_3fa31f5f:

    # "Over at the corner of the room, a nurse and a physician were likely putting that recruit's face back together."
    "방 구석에서는, 간호사와 의사가 아마도 그 신병의 얼굴을 다시 붙이고 있을 것이다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/qst_ForgedInFire.rpy:133
translate kr qst_ForgedInFire_EnterMedwardAfterHeadbuttLines_098a2684:

    # "As I remembered the scene in vivid details, a snapping sound echoed across the room."
